1
00:00:01,160 --> 00:00:02,120
公共播报:大家请注意,
Public Announcement: Attention people;

2
00:00:02,260 --> 00:00:05,740
有兴趣在多娜护士假释听证会上做证的人,请到办公室报告.
those interested in testifying at Nurse Downer's parole hearing should

3
00:00:05,740 --> 00:00:08,080
祝大家一天顺利.
report to the office.Have a nice day.

4
00:00:08,280 --> 00:00:11,480
卢克:好了,她来了.现在冲刺的时候到了.
Luke: All right, there she is.The time to strike is now.

5
00:00:11,800 --> 00:00:13,080
本:没有什么东西从我鼻子流出来吧?
Ben: Nothing weird hanging out of my nose?

6
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:15,680
卢克 :跟平常一样.
Luke: Just the usual.

7
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,080
本:什么?那好吧!我不去了!
Ben: What?That's it!I'm not going!

8
00:00:18,480 --> 00:00:20,160
卢克:就到那里去跟她说两句.
Luke: Just get over there and talk to her.

9
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:22,000
本:嘿,贝克.
Ben: Hi, Becka.

10
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:22,700
贝克:嘿,本.
Becka: Hi, Ben.

11
00:00:22,700 --> 00:00:23,100
本:听着…
Ben: Listen...

12
00:00:23,720 --> 00:00:27,700
剃刀:嘿!四眼!我让你跟贝克说话了吗?
Razor: Hey!Four eyes!Did I say that you could talk to Becka?

13
00:00:28,520 --> 00:00:29,780
本:实际上,我叫本.
Ben: Actually, my name's Ben.

14
00:00:30,400 --> 00:00:33,500
剃刀:闭嘴!知道吗,
Razor: Shut up!You know, I don't like your attitude.

15
00:00:33,880 --> 00:00:36,320
我不喜欢你这态度.我讨厌你说话的样子.我甚至讨厌你的呼吸的摸样.
I don't like the way you talk.I don't even like the way you breath.

16
00:00:40,120 --> 00:00:42,420
本:鼻音轻了?鼻音重了?还是从嘴里吐气多了?
Ben: Less nasal?More nasal?A little more through the mouth?

17
00:00:44,420 --> 00:00:47,480
剃刀:事实上,你身上唯一让我喜欢的就是你的帽子.
Razor: In fact, the only thing I do like about you is your cap.

18
00:00:48,100 --> 00:00:49,220
本:谢谢,我刚买的.
Ben: Thanks, I just got it.

19
00:00:49,280 --> 00:00:50,100
剃刀:把它给我.
Razor: Give it to me.

20
00:00:50,100 --> 00:00:50,600
本:什么?
Ben: What?

21
00:00:51,240 --> 00:00:52,820
剃刀:快把它摘下来,放在我的手上.
Razor: Take it off your head,

22
00:00:52,820 --> 00:01:01,220
我数三下.1!
and put it in my hand by the time I count to three.One!Two...Chicken.

23
00:01:02,280 --> 00:01:03,400
2…小鸡!为什么不快点儿.
Why don't you cluck?

24
00:01:04,600 --> 00:01:06,360
本:听着,剃刀,我知道你很历害,
Ben: Look, Razor, I know you're a tough guy,

25
00:01:06,400 --> 00:01:12,100
可有些事我是不会去做的.啊,那么我们在这里谈什么呢?
but there are certain things I will not do.Uh, so what are we talking here?

26
00:01:12,100 --> 00:02:22,800
谈罗德岛怪物,那可是有点…(咯咯叫)?还是泽西岛巨人,那可有点…(咯咯叫)?
Like,  Rhode Island red, which is kind of a...(clucking)?Like a Jersey giant, which is kind of ....(clucking)?

27
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:25,400
麦琪:克莉丝,我说过了,进浴室去.
Maggie: Chrissy, I told you to get in the bath.

28
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:27,400
克莉丝:我不想进.
Chrissy: I don't want to.

29
00:02:27,400 --> 00:02:28,600
杰森:(清喉咙)
Jason: (clearing throat)

30
00:02:28,600 --> 00:02:34,800
克莉丝:好吧,爸爸!随便你说什么!
Chrissy: Okay, daddy!Whatever you say!

31
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:42,600
麦琪:等一等,她这么不听我话,你就光清清喉咙?这算什么,是一种最简单的心理艺术,还是什么?
Maggie: Wait a minute.She ignores me totally, and you just clear your throat?What is this, some kind of psychological minimalist type of thing?

32
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:45,640
杰森:不,不,
Jason: No, no.Just kind of a, you know,

33
00:02:45,740 --> 00:02:47,080
只是有一点,你知道,是鸡骨头卡在喉咙里了.
choking on a Chik-let kind of thing.

34
00:02:50,660 --> 00:02:53,400
本:就这样!我已经下决心了,
Ben: That's it!I've made my decision, and you're not talking me out of it.

35
00:02:53,620 --> 00:02:54,520
你们不必再劝我了.我要一支枪.
I want a gun.

36
00:02:54,800 --> 00:02:56,600
杰森:(喘气)休想!
Jason: (gasping) Forget it!

37
00:02:58,200 --> 00:02:59,520
本:好吧,你把我劝住了.
Ben: Okay, you talked me out of it.

38
00:02:59,660 --> 00:03:00,500
第二个计划:我要去学空手道.
Here's plan B; I want to take karate lessons.

39
00:03:00,500 --> 00:03:01,400
杰森:空手道.
Jason: Karate?

40
00:03:01,400 --> 00:03:02,800
麦琪:为什么?
Maggie: Why?

41
00:03:04,500 --> 00:03:07,160
本:你们还记得花27块钱买的新帽子吗?那个在学校里被叫作"剃刀"的家伙把它抢走了,
Ben: You guys remember my brand-new $27 cap?

42
00:03:08,720 --> 00:03:10,200
就当着贝克和大家的面.
Well, this punk at school named Razor

43
00:03:10,200 --> 00:03:10,800
made me give it to him in front of Becka and everybody

44
00:03:10,800 --> 00:03:15,500
杰森:算了,本,你必须要对这种欺凌弱小的行为做斗争吗,为了…那顶27块钱买顶帽子?
Jason: Come on, Ben, you've had to deal with bullies before...$27 cap?

45
00:03:15,500 --> 00:03:19,000
本:那小子特别厉害.他是学校里的霸王.
Ben: This kid is dangerous.He is certified USDA mean.

46
00:03:19,000 --> 00:03:21,100
杰森:那么,我认为你应该把这件事报告副校长.
Jason: Well, I think you should report this to the vice-principal.

47
00:03:22,920 --> 00:03:24,380
本:是吗?去年有个同学试过了.
Ben: Yeah?A kid tried that last year.

48
00:03:24,560 --> 00:03:26,300
结果现在他隐名埋姓生活在内华达呢.
Now he's living in Nevada under an assumed name.

49
00:03:26,300 --> 00:03:28,600
杰森:一定还有更好的解决办法.本,你为什么不直接去…
Jason: There's gotta be a better way to handle this, Ben.Why don't you just go...?

50
00:03:30,580 --> 00:03:31,540
本:空手道怎么了?
Ben: What's so about karate?

51
00:03:31,840 --> 00:03:34,200
它启发人的哲学思维,它的动作优雅,
I mean, it's philosophical, it's graceful,

52
00:03:34,200 --> 00:03:34,600
还能教你如何用脚踹别人的头.
and it teaches you how to put your foot through somebody's brain.

53
00:03:34,600 --> 00:03:39,000
麦琪:噢!本,你如果为这去学空手道,那就别想了.
Maggie: Oh!Ben, if that's why you want to learn karate, you can forget it.

54
00:03:40,860 --> 00:03:43,420
本:好啊!
Ben: Fine!Then let me go look in my closet to see if I have anything

55
00:03:43,420 --> 00:03:43,700
那让我看看衣橱里还有什么剃刀可以穿上身的.
else in Razor's size.

56
00:03:45,800 --> 00:03:48,420
杰森:本!等一等,
Jason: Ben!Wait a minute, Ben.

57
00:03:48,420 --> 00:03:50,300
本.麦琪,也许让他上几堂空手道课程并不是个坏主意.
Maggie, maybe it's not such a bad idea to let him take a few karate lessons.

58
00:03:50,300 --> 00:03:51,100
麦琪:不行.
Maggie: No way.

59
00:03:52,920 --> 00:03:54,140
杰森:你不懂这是怎么回事.
Jason: Well, you don't know what it's like.

60
00:03:54,320 --> 00:03:56,520
你没尝过在学校里被人欺负的滋味.
You've never had somebody bully you around at school.

61
00:03:56,780 --> 00:03:58,100
麦琪:实话跟你说吧,
Maggie: Well, as a matter of fact,

62
00:03:58,960 --> 00:04:01,500
在整个大学一年级的时候,
Didi Ribozo tried to keep me from using the girl's bathroom the entire

63
00:04:01,500 --> 00:04:02,140
迪迪·利伯佐试图不让我用女厕所.
junior year.

64
00:04:02,700 --> 00:04:04,400
杰森:那你怎么办呢?
Jason: So what did you do?

65
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:07,500
麦琪:我在学校的时候不喝水.
Maggie: I gave up liquids during school hours.

66
00:04:07,500 --> 00:04:11,100
杰森:看,你让步了.你不希望本也使用这种方式吧.
Jason: See, you gave in.That's not the way you want Ben to solve this.

67
00:04:12,720 --> 00:04:13,880
麦琪:我明白,杰森.
Maggie: Well, I know that, Jason.

68
00:04:13,880 --> 00:04:15,000
但我也不希望他用脚踹别人的脑袋.
But I also don't want him putting his foot through someone's brain.

69
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:18,000
杰森:现在,别人的脑袋在本的帽子里呢.
Jason: Well, right now, someone's brain is inside Ben's cap.

70
00:04:19,860 --> 00:04:21,300
跟你一样,我也不喜欢暴力.
I don't like violence any more than you do,

71
00:04:21,300 --> 00:04:22,700
可他如果知道任何保护自己,咱们俩感觉会好些.
but we're both gonna feel better if he knows how to protect himself.

72
00:04:22,700 --> 00:04:25,900
麦琪:是啊,可我还是希望他能和那个孩子讲道理.
Maggie: Yeah, but I just wish there was some way he could reason with this boy.

73
00:04:27,580 --> 00:04:30,940
杰森:麦琪,这是我的经验,
Jason: Maggie, it is my experience there are two kinds of people;

74
00:04:31,200 --> 00:04:33,900
世界上有两种人:一种人可以跟他讲道理,另一种人就像剃刀这样的.
those you reason with, and those named Razor.

75
00:04:34,400 --> 00:04:38,500
德怀特:迈克,我真的很感激,你能抽出时间来帮我买车.
Dwight: Mike, I really appreciate you taking the time to help me sell my car.

76
00:04:40,340 --> 00:04:41,420
迈克:啊,我怎么能不帮你呢?
Mike: Oh, how could I not help?

77
00:04:41,500 --> 00:04:45,000
而且,德怀特,你有可能娶开萝尔,
And Dwight, you could be the man that marries Carol, and takes her far,

78
00:04:45,100 --> 00:04:46,500
把她带到很远很远的地方.我还得提前谢你呢.
far away.I'm just thanking you in advance.

79
00:04:46,500 --> 00:04:48,900
买车人一:打扰了,我是来买车的.
Car buyer1: Excuse me.I'm her about the car.

80
00:04:48,900 --> 00:04:53,000
迈克:哦,好的!老实告诉你,这车一出厂,模型就销毁了.
Mike: Oh, yes!I'm telling you, they broke the mold when they made this baby.

81
00:04:54,760 --> 00:04:55,900
德怀特:哦,但愿这是真的.
Dwight: Oh, I sure hope so.

82
00:04:56,020 --> 00:04:58,560
这车的毛病不少:发热管坏了,传送带老化了,
It's got a faulty heater hose, the fan belt's worn out,

83
00:04:58,640 --> 00:05:00,320
下雨发动不起来,发动机老是嗡嗡嗡的响,
it doesn't start in the rain, the starter kinda goes ruhn-ruhn,

84
00:05:02,700 --> 00:05:05,500
还有就是一打开收音机指示灯就灭了.
and when you turn the radio on the lights go off.

85
00:05:05,500 --> 00:05:08,500
买车人一:再见!
Car buyer1: Good luck!

86
00:05:08,500 --> 00:05:10,700
迈克:德怀特!你干什么啊?
Mike: Dwight!What are you doing?

87
00:05:10,700 --> 00:05:12,500
德怀特:实话实说啊.
Dwight: Telling the truth.

88
00:05:12,500 --> 00:05:14,300
迈克:这样能卖二手车吗?
Mike: To sell a used car?

89
00:05:14,300 --> 00:05:16,900
德怀特:迈克,你不是在建议我撒谎,是吗?
Dwight: Mike, you aren't suggesting that I lie, are you?

90
00:05:16,900 --> 00:05:19,200
迈克:不!我在命令你撒谎.
Mike: No!I'm ordering you to lie.

91
00:05:20,820 --> 00:05:22,760
德怀特:迈克,我这辈子就撒过一次谎.
Dwight: Mike, I've only lied once in my whole life.

92
00:05:22,820 --> 00:05:24,900
我没洗手,却告诉我妈饭前我洗过手了.
I told my mother that I'd washed my hands before dinner when I hadn't.

93
00:05:26,520 --> 00:05:28,140
话音刚落,
The words were barely out of my mouth,

94
00:05:28,140 --> 00:05:32,340
就有一大块不明飞行物从我家房顶上猛砸了下来.这就是征兆,
when a very large piece of Skylab came crashing down through our roof.

95
00:05:33,180 --> 00:05:33,400
迈克.
It was an omen, Mike.

96
00:05:34,320 --> 00:05:38,800
迈克:好吧,小鸡.
Mike: Okay, Chicken Little.Well, then we won't call it lying.

97
00:05:38,880 --> 00:05:41,620
那么,我们不管这叫撒谎.我们只是在强调它的优点.
We'll just call it accentuating the positive.

98
00:05:42,160 --> 00:05:45,400
你应该好好想一想这辆车有什么好处,而且对得起良心.
You know, try to think of the good things you can say about the car with a clear conscience.

99
00:05:45,800 --> 00:05:47,000
德怀特:如果有人从后面撞了这辆车,
Dwight: If you get hit from behind,

100
00:05:47,060 --> 00:05:48,500
它很有可能不会爆炸.
there's a pretty good chance it won't explode.

101
00:05:48,500 --> 00:05:50,500
迈克:好!你看,这不难,对不对?
Mike: Great!You see, that's not so hard, is it?

102
00:05:50,500 --> 00:05:51,100
德怀特:是的.
Dwight: No.

103
00:05:51,100 --> 00:05:51,700
迈克:好了.
Mike: Okay.

104
00:05:51,700 --> 00:05:52,900
德怀特:但我不撒谎.
Dwight: But I will not lie.

105
00:05:54,780 --> 00:05:55,460
迈克:德怀特,我百分之一百一的赞成你.
Mike: Dwight, I'm with you 110 percent.

106
00:05:56,440 --> 00:05:58,920
好了,咱们边修里程表边商量吧.
Okay, let's talk about it while we roll back the odometer.

107
00:06:02,700 --> 00:06:05,000
麦琪:好了,本,我们必须到后面拿你的训练服了.
Maggie: Okay, Ben, we have to go in back to get your uniform.

108
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:31,500
本:哦,我就去.(梦境:本的拳头)
Ben: Oh, I'll be right there.[Dream sequence: The Five Fingers of Ben]

109
00:06:32,900 --> 00:06:35,700
长毛大汉:嘿,你!
Villian leader: Hey, there, you!Blond boy!

110
00:06:37,200 --> 00:06:38,000
黄毛小子!有人说,你在到处找我?
People say you are looking around to find me.

111
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:44,200
本:正确!我恨你恨得咬牙切齿.(集体起哄)
Ben: Correct!I hate you with great hatred.[gang noises]

112
00:06:45,540 --> 00:06:47,300
长毛大汉:在你找的时候,
Villian leader: While you are looking for us,

113
00:06:47,420 --> 00:06:49,200
我们已经把你们的人全杀光了.
we have decimated your little town.

114
00:06:49,200 --> 00:06:54,800
长毛大汉:(笑)还打死了你的金鱼.
Villian: (laughing) And pistol-whipped your goldfish.

115
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:57,300
本:你会死的很难看.
Ben: Prepare for a very painful death.

116
00:06:58,820 --> 00:07:02,560
长毛大汉:安静!我厌倦了这种絮絮叨叨的方式.
Villian leader: Silence!I am tired of this snappy patter.

117
00:07:03,100 --> 00:07:05,440
动手吧,让我们干净利落地打一场吧.(叫喊声)
Let us fight and make snappy patter.

118
00:07:12,300 --> 00:07:21,700
本:你打起来就像我的贝莎阿姨.
Ben: You fight like my aunt Bertha.

119
00:07:23,060 --> 00:07:25,060
本:真可惜,你们只有5个.
Ben: It's a pity there are only five of you.

120
00:07:25,260 --> 00:07:28,200
我本来希望能出出汗的.你们这群臭虫.
I was hoping to break a sweat.Swamp-dwelling insects.

121
00:07:28,200 --> 00:07:50,300
长毛大汉:消灭他.(打斗声)
Villian leader: Destroy him.[fighting sounds]

122
00:07:50,300 --> 00:07:52,300
本:(笑)
Ben: (laughing)

123
00:07:53,640 --> 00:07:59,020
长毛大汉:黄毛小子!你还不赖,不过要想跟我打,你的手脚最好还是再灵活点儿.(打斗声)
Villian leader: Blond boy!You are not bad, but you must fight with greater dexterity

124
00:07:59,020 --> 00:08:00,940
if you want to challenge me.[fighting sounds

125
00:08:33,600 --> 00:08:37,100
长毛大汉:现在,我要打烂你的脸.(笑)
Villian leader: And now, I shall laugh in your face.(laughing)

126
00:08:37,100 --> 00:08:56,900
本:没有人敢来打我的脸.现在是我打烂你的脸.(笑)现在,让你尝尝我的拳头.
Ben: Nobody laughs in my face.It is I who shall laugh in yours.(laughing)  And now, prepare yourself to taste my fist.

127
00:08:56,900 --> 00:08:58,600
本:啊-呀!
Ben: Ai-yah!

128
00:08:58,600 --> 00:09:00,900
麦琪:本,你没事吧?
Maggie: Ben, are you okay?

129
00:09:00,900 --> 00:09:06,800
本:哦,是的.
Ben: Oh, yeah!

130
00:09:06,800 --> 00:09:13,500
西蒙:再快点!再来一遍!1,2,3,4!
Sim: Faster!Again!One, two, three, four!

131
00:09:13,500 --> 00:09:17,200
麦琪:呃,哦,打扰一下,打扰了.呃,西蒙师傅,西蒙师傅.
Maggie: Uh, uh, excuse me, excuse me, uh, Master Sim, Master Sim...

132
00:09:17,200 --> 00:09:21,300
西蒙:告诉我,本.你看见过眼镜蛇和黄鼠狼打架吗?
Sim: Tell me, Ben.Have you ever seen a fight between cobra and mongoose?

133
00:09:21,300 --> 00:09:25,200
本:呃,只看过迈克和爸爸因为房租的事打过…
Ben: Uh, just Mike and my dad when the rent's due.

134
00:09:25,200 --> 00:09:32,300
西蒙:道理一样:攻击,发攻击.准备好!我们要加快节奏了.上!1,2,3…
Sim: Same principal; attack, counter-attack.Get ready!We're gonna go faster now.Go!One, two, three...

135
00:09:32,300 --> 00:09:34,700
麦琪:不,不!西蒙师傅,求你了!你会伤着他的.
Maggie: No!No!Master Sim, please!You might hurt him.

136
00:09:34,700 --> 00:09:36,700
本:啊,妈妈…
Ben: Aw, mom.

137
00:09:36,700 --> 00:09:42,000
西蒙:本,休息一下.
Sim: Ben, take a break.

138
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:45,500
麦琪:对不起,西蒙师傅,但这太暴力了.
Maggie: I'm sorry, Master Sim, but this is all much too violent.

139
00:09:47,320 --> 00:09:51,940
西蒙:西沃太太,空手道不是暴力.
Sim: Karate is not about violence, Mrs.Seaver.Karate is about control.

140
