Ben: No, mom.I'll just be showing you how I'm learning to defend myself.Is that all right Master Sim?

145
00:10:10,560 --> 00:10:15,280
西蒙:是的.不过记住你妈妈没学过,
Sim: Yes, but remember your mother has had no lessons, so block her blows,

146
00:10:15,280 --> 00:10:15,800
所以只格挡她的进攻,不能挥拳还击.
but don't counter-punch.

147
00:10:15,800 --> 00:10:17,600
本:好的,妈妈.试一下,打我.
Ben: Okay, mom.Just try and punch me.

148
00:10:17,600 --> 00:10:20,600
麦琪:啊!啊!
Maggie: Ah!Oh!

149
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:25,700
本:妈妈,是冲拳,不是拍打.来吧.
Ben: Mom, a punch, not a slap.Come on.

150
00:10:25,700 --> 00:10:27,800
