Sim: Good footwork, Ben.

151
00:10:27,800 --> 00:10:30,600
本:好,妈妈.这次要真的使劲才行.
Ben: Okay, mom.Now really let me have it this time.

152
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:32,500
麦琪:好的,本.准备好.
Maggie: Okay, Ben.If you're sure.

153
00:10:32,500 --> 00:10:34,400
本:哎吆!
Ben: Ai-yah!

154
00:10:35,720 --> 00:10:40,300
麦琪:(击打本)哦!哦!哦,我的天啊,本!
Maggie: (hitting Ben) Oh!Oh!Oh, my God!Oh, Ben!Are you all right, sweetheart?

155
00:10:40,660 --> 00:10:41,740
你没事吧,宝贝?哦!哦,亲爱的!
Oh!Oh, honey!

156
