迈克:嘿,本,我一直在思考你的问题.
Mike: Hey, you know, Ben, I've been thinking about your problem.

157
00:10:51,500 --> 00:10:54,840
哦,我觉得你如果在以后三年的时间里坚持练空手道,
And I really think that if you keep up this karate,

