之后,还有谁?外婆?开萝尔?也许学校里一大半女孩.
After that, who knows; grandma, Carol, probably most of the girls at school.

160
00:11:14,940 --> 00:11:18,000
本:妈妈打败了我.哥哥取笑我.
Ben: My mother clocks me.My brother makes fun of me.

161
00:11:18,780 --> 00:11:20,420
我能有多么差啊?(梦境)
How much worse can this get?[Dream sequence: Enter The Wimp]

162
00:11:23,700 --> 00:11:27,800
麦琪:嘿,你,小黄毛.我看你有些情绪低落,羞愧难当.
Maggie: Hey, you, little blond boy.I see you are depressed and humiliated.

163
00:11:27,800 --> 00:11:30,900
本:哦,求你了妈妈,别取笑我了.
Ben: Oh, please, mom.Don't make fun of me.

164
00:11:34,060 --> 00:11:37,520
麦琪:别傻了,小黄毛.
Maggie: Don't be silly, little blond boy.I would never do such a thing.

165
00:11:37,520 --> 00:11:40,000
我永远不会取笑你的,除非有人跟我合伙,当然是家里人或是朋友.
Unless I had help of course, from family and friends.

166
00:11:43,220 --> 00:11:49,820
Jason: You are so very weak.I have replaced your CD's with....Perry Como records

167
00:11:49,900 --> 00:11:52,800
迈克:还涂抹了你的吉他.
Mike: And painted your guitar.

168
00:11:52,800 --> 00:11:55,300
卢克:还偷了你的女朋友.
Luke: And stolen your girlfriends.

169
00:11:55,300 --> 00:11:59,800
杰森:还给你的床铺上有小心脏和小花的床单.
Jason: And put new sheets on your bed decorated with tiny hearts and flowers.

170
00:11:59,800 --> 00:12:01,900
本:来吧,你们.
Ben: Come on, you guys.

171
00:12:01,900 --> 00:12:08,100
全家:(空手道声)
Entire family: (karate sounds)

172
00:12:08,100 --> 00:12:11,800
麦琪:我打他都打烦了.让他学校里的朋友们来打吧.
Maggie: I grow weary of these attacks.Let his friends at school attack him.

173
00:12:11,800 --> 00:12:14,900
本:不,求你了,妈妈,别让我去学校.
Ben: No, please, mom, don't make me go to school.

174
00:12:18,020 --> 00:12:19,640
麦琪:别害怕,小黄毛.
Maggie: Have no fear, little blond boy.

175
