Chrissy: Ai-yah!I will protect you, little blond boy.

177
00:12:26,120 --> 00:12:28,520
小黄毛.然后,我就嘲笑你了(笑)
And then I shall laugh in your face.(laughing)

178
00:12:37,300 --> 00:12:41,500
麦琪:嘿,本,你没吃完早饭.
Maggie: Hey, Ben.You didn't finish your breakfast.

179
00:12:41,500 --> 00:12:45,400
