买车人二:(叹气)说到我的心窝里了.(喘气)看,下面那一团黑东西是什么?
Car buyer2: (sighing)  Isn't that sweet!(gasping)  Say, what's that black puddle under there?

195
00:13:46,680 --> 00:13:48,820
迈克:哦,这完全正常.呃,
Mike: Oh, uh, th-that's perfectly normal.

196
00:13:49,300 --> 00:13:53,380
这,就像人热了要出汗一样,呃,车正在冒湿气.
Uh, it's, well, just the same way that your body sweats, uh,

197
00:13:53,640 --> 00:13:59,100
哦,嗯,这是健康的标志.
a car releases moisture.It's, uh, a sign of health.

198
00:14:01,720 --> 00:14:07,620
买车人二:哦,我的朋友们说,我应该找个机械师好好检查一下.
Car buyer2: Well, my friends say I should have it checked by a mechanic,

