Dwight: Well, Mike, I guess you're right.

207
00:14:51,640 --> 00:14:54,120
说真话永远卖不了这辆车.
We'll never sell the car by telling the truth.

208
00:15:01,180 --> 00:15:05,860
迈克:哦,是吗?我有主意了.德怀特,
Mike: Oh, yeah?Well, I got an idea.Dwight, you pop the hood.

209
00:15:06,020 --> 00:15:08,180
打开车盖.我去拿工具,咱们把车修一修.
I'm gonna get my tools.You and I are gonna fix this car.

210
00:15:10,000 --> 00:15:14,000
迈克:德怀特,那是行李箱.
Mike: Dwight, that's the trunk.

211
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:22,000
德怀特:哦,我的上帝!我把油加哪儿了?
Dwight: Oh, my God!Where have I been putting the oil?

212
00:15:22,000 --> 00:15:24,500
杰森:好,就这样.我们就用你的方法对付本.
Jason: Okay.All right.We'll deal with Ben your way.

213
