可你没有任何理由不去接着上空手道课.
But there's no reason why you can't go right back to karate class.

220
00:15:49,100 --> 00:15:51,160
麦琪:杰森,你在说什么呀?!
Maggie: Jason, what are you talking about?

221
00:15:51,260 --> 00:15:51,800
跟他打的下一个人可能就不会像我这么爱他了.
The next person he fights might not love him like I do.

222
