Maggie: Jason, he wasn't just hurt.He was taken out, flattened, destroyed!

224
00:16:02,360 --> 00:16:04,700
毁掉了!被他的妈妈!对不起,宝贝,你还疼吗?
By his mommy!I'm sorry, pookie, does it still hurt?

225
