00:16:22,800 --> 00:16:25,800
本:我还以为你要给我演讲呢.
Ben: And I thought you were gonna give me a pep talk.

231
00:16:25,800 --> 00:16:27,300
杰森:帽子的事怎么样了?
Jason: And what about the cap thing?

232
00:16:27,300 --> 00:16:32,600
麦琪:哦,这很简单.从现在起,我们就给他穿朴素,简单的衣服,这样就不会有其他的孩子抢了.
Maggie: Oh, it's very simple.From now on, we dress him in plain, generic clothes that no other kid would be caught dead in.

233
00:16:32,600 --> 00:16:33,500
本:等一下…
Ben: Wait a minute....

234
00:16:33,500 --> 00:16:34,800
麦琪:杰森,让他放弃吧.
Maggie: Jason, let him quit.

235
00:16:34,800 --> 00:16:37,300
杰森:哦,我们都把空手道课的学费交了.
Jason: Oh, we still gotta eat the cost of those karate lessons.

236
00:16:37,300 --> 00:16:38,300
麦琪:克莉丝可以继续上.
Maggie: Well, Chrissy can take them.

237
00:16:38,300 --> 00:16:39,000
杰森:啊.
Jason: Ah.

238
00:16:41,420 --> 00:16:43,680
麦琪:亲爱的,我们要面对现实.很明显,
Maggie: Honey, we should just face it.

239
00:16:43,800 --> 00:16:48,020
本不具备练武的天赋,他没有动力,或者说能力.
It's obvious that Ben doesn't have the talent, the drive, or the ability.

240
00:16:48,400 --> 00:16:54,100
杰森:就是啊.他是个笨蛋.
Jason: God knows, he's a klutz.

241
00:16:57,060 --> 00:17:01,280
本:好了,好了,我开始认识到"见鬼,我能做到"的含义了,
Ben: Okay, okay.I'm starting to feel that "heck, I can do it" Seaver spirit.

242
00:17:02,260 --> 00:17:03,940
在就是西沃家的精神.妈妈,爸爸,我要继续学空手道.
Mom, dad, I'm going back to karate.

243
00:17:06,160 --> 00:17:09,740
要知道,以前你们"一个白脸,
And you know, you guys used to be much better at this "good cop,

244
