267
00:19:48,000 --> 00:19:55,800
迈克:德怀特!你这个吃货,卷毛,中世纪的笨蛋!我为你这台破车付出了500块钱的劳动力.
Mike: Dwight!You cheese-eating, tangle-haired, medieval moron!I put over $500 of labor into this hunk of junk!

268
00:19:55,800 --> 00:20:01,000
德怀特:谢谢你.
Dwight: Thank you.

269
00:20:01,000 --> 00:20:03,500
卢克:哇!嘿,本!焕然一新啊.
Luke: Woo!Hey, Ben!Looking fresh.

270
00:20:03,500 --> 00:20:07,200
本:谢谢.
Ben: Thanks.

271
00:20:07,200 --> 00:20:10,700
本:哦,是贝克.我终于准备好跟她说话了.
Ben: Well, it's Becka.Finally I'm ready to talk to her.

272
00:20:10,700 --> 00:20:13,100
卢克:如果贝克出现了,剃刀也来了.
Luke: If Becka's around, so is Razor.

273
00:20:13,100 --> 00:20:16,000
本:别担心.我知道该做什么.
Ben: Don't worry about it.I know what to do.

274
00:20:16,000 --> 00:20:16,900
本:嘿,贝克.
Ben: Hi, Becka.

275
00:20:16,900 --> 00:20:18,100
贝克:嘿,本.
Becka: Hi, Ben.

276
00:20:18,100 --> 00:20:20,900
剃刀:嘿,笨蛋.
Razor: Hi, geek.

277
00:20:20,900 --> 00:20:21,900
本:我叫本.
Ben: The name's Ben.

278
00:20:21,900 --> 00:20:26,400
剃刀:哦,对了.你把它写在我的新帽子里了.
Razor: Oh, that's right.You had it written inside my new hat.

279
00:20:26,400 --> 00:20:28,400
本:听着,我不想惹麻烦.
Ben: Look, I don't want any trouble.

280
00:20:31,400 --> 00:20:33,140
剃刀:哦,是吗?
Razor: Oh, yeah?Well, you know what I want?

281
00:20:33,760 --> 00:20:34,500
那好,知道我想干要什么吗?我想要你穿的这件新夹克.
I want that nice, new jacket you've got on.

282
00:20:34,500 --> 00:20:37,100
本:好了,他站在我左边四分之三位.
Ben: Okay, he's facing me three-quarters to the left.

283
00:20:39,960 --> 00:20:43,100
这样他没法对付我的进攻.我只要虚晃一下,进步向前,反踢他的肋骨,最后击打他的鼻子,把他打翻在地.
That leaves him wide open for a fake jab, step in, back-kick to the

284
00:20:43,100 --> 00:20:43,300
ribs, and I can finish him off with a palm thrust to the nose

285
00:20:46,360 --> 00:20:48,520
剃刀:你在看什么,笨蛋?
Razor: What are you staring at, geek?Am I gonna have to bust you one?

286
00:20:49,220 --> 00:20:51,100
想让我动手吗?我说了现在给我.
I said give it to me now.

287
00:20:58,300 --> 00:21:05,400
卢克:快叫护士,快,这家伙受伤了.
Luke: Somebody get the nurse, quick, this guys hurt.

288
00:21:05,400 --> 00:21:10,900
剃刀:你在看什么,笨蛋?想让我动手吗?我说了现在给我.
Razor: What are you staring at, geek?Am I gonna have to bust you one?I said give it to me now.

289
00:21:10,900 --> 00:21:18,000
卢克:不,我不会给你夹克的,或者其他什么,再也不了.
Luke: No.I'm not giving you this jacket, or anything else ever again.

290
00:21:18,000 --> 00:21:25,500
剃刀:哇呜!成大人了?在说大话呢.好吧,笨蛋,过来.练两下,看看你都学了些什么.成硬汉了,哦!
Razor: Whoa!Big man, huh?Big words.All right, geek, c'mon, let's throw.Show me what you've got, tough guy, huh!

291
00:21:25,500 --> 00:21:27,800
来吧,就在这练练,就现在!上来吧!
C'mon, let's go for it right here, right now!Go for it!

292
00:21:27,800 --> 00:21:33,300
卢克:他一点没防备.这个纨绔子弟没见过这个.稳住,不要碰他,除非时机到了.
Luke: He's wide open.The dude will never see it coming.Control.Don't touch him unless you have to.

293
00:21:33,300 --> 00:21:39,000
剃刀:来啊,笨蛋.上来啊.哦!哦!(咯咯叫)
Razor: C'mon, geek, let's go for it.Huh!Huh!(clucking)

294
00:21:39,000 --> 00:21:41,600
本:我不想跟你打.
Ben: I'm not gonna fight you.

295
00:21:44,580 --> 00:21:46,980
剃刀:听见了吗?他说不想跟我动手.
Razor: Did you hear that?He said he's not gonna fight me, huh.

296
00:21:47,560 --> 00:21:48,880
嗯,我该做什么呢?
What am I supposed to do, huh?

297
00:21:48,880 --> 00:21:49,600
站在他面前,把他当沙袋用吗?
Stand on his feet, and use him like a punching bag?

298
00:21:49,600 --> 00:21:56,300
(笑)看看这个傻瓜,他僵住了.走吧,宝贝,咱们走吧.
(laughing) Look at the dude, he's frozen.Come on, babe, let's get out of here.

299
00:21:56,300 --> 00:21:58,100
卢克:嘿,兄弟,你真令人吃惊.
Luke: Hey, man, you were amazing.

300
00:21:58,100 --> 00:22:01,300
本:谢谢.我叉嗲就跟他动粗了.
Ben: Thanks.I came real close to getting ugly.

301
00:22:01,300 --> 00:22:05,200
卢克:哦,说到动粗,你可以忘掉贝克的.她不值得你这样.
Luke: Well, speaking of ugly, you can forget about Becka.She's not worth it.

302
00:22:05,200 --> 00:22:06,900
盖尔:对不起,本?
Gail: Excuse, me.Ben?

303
00:22:06,900 --> 00:22:08,100
本:什么?
Ben: Yeah?

304
00:22:08,100 --> 00:22:10,900
盖尔:我真的很喜欢你刚才的样子.
Gail: I really like the way you handled that creep.

305
00:22:10,900 --> 00:22:12,900
本:谢谢.
Ben: Thanks.

306
00:22:12,900 --> 00:22:14,900
盖尔:午饭给你留个位置?
本:当然.我总是很饿.
00:22:14,900
Gail: Save you a seat at lunch? Ben: Sure.I'm always hungry.
